This will give you the open-loop (0,0) → (2,3) demonstration using your measured motor speed. Because the encoder is not actually mounted on the robot, the robot cannot know whether it really travelled exactly 30 cm or 20 cm. Wheel slip, battery voltage, floor friction, etc. can change the distance.

